WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.498
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Excel: Make a Chart.

2
00:00:05.798 --> 00:00:09.972
Turn numbers into a clear chart. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:10.983 --> 00:00:15.984
Step one. Select your data. Drag the mouse from cell A one to cell B four.

4
00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:20.831
Step two. Click the Insert tab and look for Charts.

5
00:00:21.817 --> 00:00:28.352
Step three. Choose a Column chart. Excel draws the chart for you. Taller columns mean bigger numbers.

6
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:37.659
Step four. Click the chart title and type a clear name, such as Marks by Subject. A good title tells the reader what the chart shows.

7
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:42.707
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:43.007 --> 00:00:45.192
Make a column chart of your own data.

9
00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:47.062
Change the chart title.

10
00:00:47.362 --> 00:00:49.699
Try a pie chart for parts of a whole.

11
00:00:49.999 --> 00:00:51.139
Well done!

